     "up": {"title":"Match the command word (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>A Paper 02 question is set on a pharmacy in Roseau, Dominica, where prescriptions are delayed while handwriting is checked with the clinic by phone. Match each command word to the answer that does exactly what it asks. Some answers look alike, so read them closely.</p>","pairs":[{"l":"Define","r":"A problem is a gap between the current state and the desired state that causes loss or difficulty for someone."},{"l":"Explain","r":"Problem-solving is a process because the pharmacy follows ordered stages, each using the previous stage's findings, so its fix targets the real cause."},{"l":"Describe","r":"In the analyse stage, staff time each prescription, find that unclear handwriting must be checked by phone, and list the budget and Internet limits."},{"l":"Identify","r":"E-prescriptions sent from the clinic; a second pharmacist at peak times."},{"l":"Evaluate","r":"E-prescriptions remove the phone checks, but they depend on the clinic's Internet, which can fail during storms."},{"l":"Justify","r":"E-prescriptions are optimal because, unlike a second pharmacist, they remove the cause of the delays at a fraction of the yearly cost."},{"l":"Distinguish between","r":"Stage 3 judges the options before any is chosen, whereas stage 6 judges the chosen solution after it is in use."}],"win":"Well matched. Define gives a precise meaning, explain gives reasons, describe gives detail, identify names briefly, evaluate weighs strengths and weaknesses, justify defends a choice by comparison, and distinguish states the difference with \"whereas\"."}
