      "teacherTip": "<p>Mark (b) strictly: one mark each for who/what, how and consequence, and none if a part names a solution. Dial-down tip: once a student scores well here, move them to the full 15-mark version, which asks for two evaluated solutions and a comparative justification.</p>"
