     "title": "Waterfall: strengths and weaknesses",
     "intro": "<p>Windward Customs Brokers in Roseau is having its declarations software built with the Waterfall model. Sort each thing that happens on the project as an <b>advantage</b> or a <b>disadvantage</b> of Waterfall.</p>",
