      "prompt": "<p>(a) Complete this sentence: \"Prototyping builds a ... so that users can ..., whereas iterative/incremental development delivers the system in ...\" <b>[2 marks]</b></p><p>(b) Name ONE software development model you recommend for the Sunset Reef Hotel app. <b>[1 mark]</b></p><p>(c) Copy TWO clues from the scenario. For EACH clue, write one sentence saying how your model helps the hotel. <b>[4 marks: 1 for each clue, 1 for each explanation]</b></p><p>(d) State ONE disadvantage of the model you recommended. <b>[1 mark]</b></p>",
      "min": 80,
      "max": 220,
