     "up": {"title":"Normal, boundary or erroneous? (Challenge)","bloom":"Apply","intro":"<p>Saba Dive Centre's booking form accepts divers aged <b>12 to 65 inclusive</b>, entered as a whole number. Classify each test value for the test plan. Watch the values just outside the range.</p>","items":[{"t":"A diver aged 30","bin":0,"fb":"Valid and comfortably inside the range: normal."},{"t":"A diver aged 47","bin":0,"fb":"Valid and typical: normal."},{"t":"A diver aged 12","bin":1,"fb":"The lowest valid age: boundary."},{"t":"A diver aged 65","bin":1,"fb":"The highest valid age: boundary."},{"t":"A diver aged 11","bin":2,"fb":"Just below the range, so it must be rejected: erroneous."},{"t":"A diver aged 66","bin":2,"fb":"Just above the range, so it must be rejected: erroneous."},{"t":"The age is entered as 12.5","bin":2,"fb":"Not a whole number, so it is invalid: erroneous."},{"t":"The age box is left blank","bin":2,"fb":"No value at all should be rejected: erroneous."},{"t":"The age is typed as \"sixty\"","bin":2,"fb":"The wrong data type: erroneous."},{"t":"The age is entered as 0","bin":2,"fb":"Far outside the range: erroneous."}],"win":"Well sorted. Both edges of the range (12 and 65) are boundary data; values just outside (11 and 66), decimals, blanks and words are erroneous; anything comfortably inside is normal."}
