     "prompt": "<p>Answer ALL parts.</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>Explain the purpose of the <b>feasibility study</b> and outline <b>economic</b> and <b>operational</b> feasibility. <i>(5 marks)</i></li><li>For EACH of the stages <b>design</b>, <b>development</b> and <b>implementation</b>, identify ONE deliverable and explain its purpose. <i>(6 marks)</i></li><li>Distinguish between a <b>user manual</b> and a <b>technical manual</b>. <i>(4 marks)</i></li></ol>",
