      "teacherTip": "<p>Dial-down version (6 marks): one mark per correct tool in (a) and (b); one mark per reason that uses a scenario number in (c); in (d), one mark for observation and one for explaining that behaviour changes because staff know they are watched. Once secure, move the student on to the full 15-mark question.</p>"
