     "up": {"title":"Sort the canteen components (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Harder labels from the Breadfruit Valley Secondary canteen system, including two that differ by a single letter. Sort each into the correct Gane and Sarson symbol.</p>","items":[{"t":"Students (the records of every registered student)","bin":2,"fb":"A plural noun for data held for later: a data store. Compare it with the entity \"Student\"."},{"t":"Student (the person placing an order)","bin":0,"fb":"A person outside the system who sends orders in: an external entity."},{"t":"Bank","bin":0,"fb":"An organisation outside the system that receives payment data: an external entity."},{"t":"Validate student ID","bin":1,"fb":"Verb plus noun, doing work on data: a process."},{"t":"Calculate daily totals","bin":1,"fb":"An action that turns stored orders into totals: a process."},{"t":"Payments","bin":2,"fb":"A plural noun for records kept: a data store."},{"t":"card payment details","bin":3,"fb":"Data moving between symbols: a data flow."},{"t":"daily totals","bin":3,"fb":"The output of a process on its way to the bursar: a data flow."},{"t":"Bursar","bin":0,"fb":"A role outside the system that receives reports: an external entity."},{"t":"Menu","bin":2,"fb":"Menu items and prices kept for later: a data store."}],"win":"Well sorted. \"Student\" the person is an entity, while \"Students\" the records is a store; verb phrases are processes; data on the move, such as \"card payment details\", are flows."}
