     "intro": "<p>Sunset Shuttle in Providenciales takes online bookings for rides from Providenciales International Airport to hotels. Passengers send a ride request and receive a booking confirmation. The system sends a payment request to the card payment provider, which returns an authorisation code. The dispatcher enters the driver roster, each driver receives a pickup list, and the owner receives a weekly earnings report. Match each data flow on the context diagram to its direction.</p>",
