      "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">The Reef Divers Dive Shop in Bridgetown takes bookings from cruise passengers who arrive at the Bridgetown cruise pier. A Diver sends a booking request and receives a booking confirmation. The shop checks the Dive Trips file for available places and records each booking in a Bookings file. Each morning a dive list is sent to the Instructor. The Manager enters new dive trips.<br><br>A trainee drew a level 1 DFD. In it: (i) process 3.0 \"Produce dive list\" sends the dive list to Instructor but has no input; (ii) Diver sends the booking request straight into the Bookings data store; (iii) process 2.0 is labelled \"Bookings\".</p>",
      "prompt": "<p>Use the Reef Divers Dive Shop passage above.</p><p>(a) Complete the sentence: \"A context level DFD shows the whole system as ________ process and ________ data stores, whereas a level 1 DFD shows ________ processes and ________ the data stores.\" <b>[2 marks]</b></p><p>(b) Give a verb-phrase name for each process: 1.0 handles the Manager's new dive trips; 2.0 handles each Diver's booking; 3.0 makes the morning list for the Instructor. <b>[3 marks]</b></p><p>(c) Name the two data stores, D1 and D2. <b>[1 mark]</b></p><p>(d) Choose the correct error name from the box for each of (i), (ii) and (iii). <i>Box: miracle · black hole · entity connected directly to a store · process labelled with a noun</i> <b>[3 marks]</b></p><p>(e) State how error (ii) should be corrected. <b>[1 mark]</b></p>",
      "min": 70,
