     "up": {"title":"Match the flowchart symbol (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Harder: match lines and features of Sea Breeze Marina's flowchart to the symbol or control structure they show.</p>","pairs":[{"l":"PRINT \"Berth fee: \", fee","r":"Parallelogram"},{"l":"nights ← nights + 1","r":"Rectangle"},{"l":"nights < stayLength?","r":"Diamond"},{"l":"STOP","r":"Oval (terminator)"},{"l":"An arrow leading back up from the end of the loop body to the decision","r":"Repetition"},{"l":"A diamond whose Yes and No paths later rejoin","r":"Selection"},{"l":"A straight column of boxes with no diamonds","r":"Sequence"},{"l":"A small circle labelled C at the foot of page 1","r":"Connector"}],"win":"Well matched. You recognised symbols from their contents and control structures from the shape of the flow: straight for sequence, rejoining paths for selection, a line back up for repetition."}
