     "up": {"title":"Put the island tour algorithm in sequence (Challenge)","bloom":"Apply","intro":"<p>Island Trails Tours has improved its booking algorithm: prices are now named constants, and 5% turnover tax is added to the cost. Put the lines in the only working order.</p>","blocks":[{"t":"START, then set ADULT_PRICE ← 45, CHILD_PRICE ← 25 and FEE ← 10"},{"t":"INPUT adults, children"},{"t":"adultCost ← adults * ADULT_PRICE and childCost ← children * CHILD_PRICE"},{"t":"cost ← adultCost + childCost + FEE"},{"t":"tax ← cost * 0.05"},{"t":"total ← cost + tax"},{"t":"OUTPUT \"Total with tax: US$\", total"},{"t":"STOP"}],"win":"Correct. Constants first, then inputs, then each calculation in the order its values become available, then the output. For 2 adults and 3 children: cost 175, tax 8.75, total US$183.75."}
