     "q": "Peak Fitness Club's app works out a \"workout score\" during a short countdown routine. What is output by this algorithm?<br><br>s ← 0<br>FOR j ← 6 DOWNTO 2 STEP -2 DO<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;s ← s + j * j<br>ENDFOR<br>OUTPUT s",
