   "model": "<p><b>(a)</b> The problem at the canteen is that students queue for up to 15 minutes of a 25-minute break, so some leave without eating.</p><p><b>(b)</b> <b>Define the problem:</b> the team would write a clear statement that the queue is too long because orders are written and added up by hand. <b>Analyse the problem:</b> the team would time the queue and interview Mrs. Hodge and students to find the causes.</p><p><b>(c)</b> External entity 1: <b>Student</b>. External entity 2: <b>Kitchen</b>. Process: <b>0 Pre-order System</b>. Data flow from the student: <b>order details and student ID</b>.</p><p><b>(d)</b></p><pre>INPUT items, cost\nIF items &gt;= 3 THEN\n   pay = cost * 0.9\nELSE\n   pay = cost\nENDIF\nOUTPUT pay</pre>",
